# Entity Relationship Diagram

This diagram represents the current database schema of the SkillSwap project after the recent refactoring (merging [Device](file:///d:/6thsem/backend/skillswap/myapp/models.py#167-185) and [PasswordResetCode](file:///d:/6thsem/backend/skillswap/myapp/models.py#141-149) into [User](file:///d:/6thsem/backend/skillswap/myapp/models.py#35-81), and removing `Dispute` and `PointTransaction`).

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USER ||--|| USER_PROFILE : "has"
    USER ||--o{ NOTIFICATION : "receives"
    USER ||--o{ SKILL_SWAP_POST : "creates"
    USER ||--o{ SKILL_SWAP_REQUEST : "sends"
    USER ||--o{ MENTOR_AVAILABILITY : "sets"
    USER ||--o{ SESSION : "participates (Learner/Mentor)"

    USER_PROFILE ||--o{ CERTIFICATION : "has"
    USER_PROFILE ||--o{ WORKING_EXPERIENCE : "has"
    USER_PROFILE ||--o{ PORTFOLIO : "has"

    SKILL_SWAP_CATEGORY ||--o{ SKILL_SWAP_POST : "categorizes"
    SKILL_SWAP_POST ||--o{ SKILL_SWAP_REQUEST : "receives"
    SKILL_SWAP_POST ||--o{ MENTOR_AVAILABILITY : "linked to"

    MENTOR_AVAILABILITY ||--o{ SESSION : "slots used in"

    USER {
        string email PK
        string full_name
        json roles
        json fcm_tokens
        string password_reset_code
        datetime password_reset_code_created_at
        boolean is_active
        boolean is_staff
        datetime created_at
    }

    USER_PROFILE {
        int user_id FK
        int points
        int held_points
        string profile_title
        text bio
        string location_province
        json skill_you_offer
        json skill_you_want_to_learn
    }

    SKILL_SWAP_POST {
        int user_id FK
        int category_id FK
        string title
        text description
        string skill_to_learn
        int points_cost
        boolean is_active
    }

    SESSION {
        int learner_id FK
        int mentor_id FK
        int availability_slot_id FK
        string skill
        datetime scheduled_time
        string status
        string meeting_link
    }

    MENTOR_AVAILABILITY {
        int mentor_id FK
        int post_id FK
        datetime start_time
        datetime end_time
        boolean is_booked
    }

    SKILL_SWAP_REQUEST {
        int post_id FK
        int requester_id FK
        string status
        datetime requested_at
    }

    CERTIFICATION {
        int user_profile_id FK
        string title
    }

    WORKING_EXPERIENCE {
        int user_profile_id FK
        string title
        string companyName
    }

    PORTFOLIO {
        int user_profile_id FK
        string title
        string url
    }

    NOTIFICATION {
        int user_id FK
        string title
        text message
        boolean is_read
    }
```
